Package: zboard
Title: Public Production Monitoring for Curated R Packages and Repositories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("José Evandeilton", "Lopes", , "evandeilton@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-5887-4084"))
Description: Collects, consolidates and publishes a static, daily-updated
    dashboard ("dashboard do Zé") consolidating CRAN check/download health,
    GitHub development activity and academic output for a curated set of R
    packages and repositories. Designed to run unattended from GitHub
    Actions with no backend: Parquet is the canonical data store (orphan
    'data' branch), JSON is derived at build time for a bilingual Quarto
    dashboard published to GitHub Pages. See SPEC.md at the repository
    root for the full, normative specification and site/about.qmd for
    declared methodological limitations.
